{"symbol":"VIO.BR","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T18:22:02Z","info":{"address1":"30 Marnix Avenue","city":"Brussels","zip":"1000","country":"Belgium","phone":"32 2 224 09 11","website":"https://www.viohalco.com","industry":"Metal Fabrication","industryKey":"metal-fabrication","industryDisp":"Metal Fabrication","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Viohalco S.A., through its subsidiaries, manufactures, and sells aluminium, copper, cables, and steel and steel pipe products. The company operates through seven segments: Aluminium, Copper, Cables, Steel Pipes, Steel, Real Estate, and Other Activities. The Aluminium segment offers aluminium products, including coils, strips, sheets, and foils for various applications; and rolled and extruded products for construction, rigid and flexible packaging, transportation, household, industrial, architectural systems, and automotive applications, as well as lithographic coils. The Copper segment provides copper and copper alloy, such as copper and brass tubes, copper strips, sheets and plates, copper bus bars, and rods. The Cables segment manufactures power, telecommunication and submarine cables, as well as enameled wires and plastic and rubber compounds. The Steel Pipes provides onshore and offshore pipelines for gas and liquid fuel, CO2, and hydrogen transportation; casing steel pipes used in exploratory drillings; and hollow structural sections used in the construction sector. The Steel segment offers long, flat, and downstream steel products. The Real Estate segment develops and manages large-scale commercial and industrial properties. The Other Activities segment produces products and solutions for the optimization of industrial and business processes. The company serves packaging, transportation, building and construction, energy and power networks, heating, ventilation, air conditioning and refrigeration, water supply, telecommunications and printing, and various industrial applications. It operates in the United States, Greece, the European Union, Asia, Africa, Oceania, and Other European countries. Viohalco S.A. was incorporated in 1937 and is headquartered in Brussels, Belgium.","fullTimeEmployees":12436,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Ippokratis Ioannis Stasinopoulos","title":"Executive Vice-Chairman & CEO","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":25000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Evangelos Dion Moustakas","title":"Executive Director","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":100000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Xavier  Bedoret","title":"Executive Director","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":462835,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jean Charles Faulx","title":"Executive Director","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":25000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Thanasis  Molokotos","title":"Executive Director","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":25000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Efstratios  Thomadakis","title":"Chief Financial Officer","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Sofia  Zairi","title":"Chief Investor Relations Officer","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1767139200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":15.5,"open":15.5,"dayLow":15.5,"dayHigh":15.82,"regularMarketPreviousClose":15.5,"regularMarketOpen":15.5,"regularMarketDayLow":15.5,"regularMarketDayHigh":15.82,"dividendRate":0.27,"dividendYield":1.74,"exDividendDate":1782345600,"payoutRatio":0.2192,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":1.56,"beta":1.135,"trailingPE":12.7154,"volume":2665,"regularMarketVolume":2665,"averageVolume":4348,"averageVolume10days":4844,"averageDailyVolume10Day":4844,"bid":0,"ask":0,"bidSize":0,"askSize":0,"marketCap":4053728000,"nonDilutedMarketCap":4017441295,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":9.74,"fiftyT